use cash machine\par
\cf2 You shove your card into the machine and type in the appropriate PIN number. The machine squeals in recognition and presents you with a screen of options. You choose to withdraw \'a31000 and the machine produces a sound which you choose to interpret as an affirmation of your withdrawal. A slight whirring sound then precedes the action of the machine spitting out both your credit card and a wad of notes to the value of \'a31000. You gather up the notes and the card.\par
\cf1 \par
s\par
\cf2 You move south.\par
The showroom is full of expensive sports cars and not so expensive second hand cars.  The Fullerton 'Hog' seems to call to you from it's space on the 'cheapo car of the week' stand. From here, you can go north to the south end of the street or south to Matthews' office, although he usually keeps it locked.  Matthews is here.\par
\cf1 \par
converse with matthews\par
\cf2 Johnny seems loathe to talk to you but then puts on his smarmy know-it-all face as he describes all of the top sports cars in the showroom, knowing full well you can't afford them. Then he lays his greasy hand on the cheapest car in the showroom, the Fullerton 'hog.' "I fear even this is out of your price range." he says, grinning at you sarcastically. At this point you coldy bid him goodbye.\par
\cf1 \par
shoot matthews\par
\cf2 You know? Thats probably the best thing you've done all year. You take out your stun-gun and shoot him in the stomach. His eyes go wide and he topples over unconscious. As he falls, he drops the key to his office, which you take.\par
